=== Module 03 - Regular Expressions: Formal Definition ===

[1] /(a|b)*abb/
    tree : (cat (cat (cat (star (alt a b)) a) b) b)
    L (up to length 6): { abb, aabb, babb, aaabb, ababb, baabb, bbabb, aaaabb, aababb, abaabb, abbabb, baaabb, ... (15 total) }
    "abb"     match
    "aabb"    match
    "babb"    match
    "abababb" match
    "ab"      no
    "abba"    no
    ""        no

[2] /a*b*/
    tree : (cat (star a) (star b))
    L (up to length 6): { epsilon, a, b, aa, ab, bb, aaa, aab, abb, bbb, aaaa, aaab, ... (28 total) }
    ""        match
    "a"       match
    "b"       match
    "ab"      match
    "aabbb"   match
    "ba"      no

[3] /(ab)*a/
    tree : (cat (star (cat a b)) a)
    L (up to length 6): { a, aba, ababa }
    "a"       match
    "aba"     match
    "ababa"   match
    "ab"      no
    "abaa"    no

[4] /a?b?c?/
    tree : (cat (cat (alt a eps) (alt b eps)) (alt c eps))
    L (up to length 6): { epsilon, a, b, c, ab, ac, bc, abc }
    ""        match
    "a"       match
    "c"       match
    "abc"     match
    "acb"     no
    "abcc"    no

[5] /a|bc*/
    tree : (alt a (cat b (star c)))
    L (up to length 6): { a, b, bc, bcc, bccc, bcccc, bccccc }
    "a"       match
    "b"       match
    "bc"      match
    "bccc"    match
    "c"       no
    "abc"     no

precedence check (tightest: * , then concatenation, then |):
    /a|bc*     ->  (alt a (cat b (star c)))
    /ab*       ->  (cat a (star b))
    /(ab)*     ->  (star (cat a b))
    /a|b|c     ->  (alt (alt a b) c)
    /ab|cd     ->  (alt (cat a b) (cat c d))

summary: regexes=5  nodeKinds=6 (Empty, Epsilon, Char, Union, Concat, Star)  sugar: + ? desugared at parse time
